    <h1>About PW Fit Guide</h1>
    <p>This site exists because “universal M22 hose” is a bad search result. The thread is common. The stem is not. We write identification pages so a replacement hose, gun, or foam cannon seals on the first try.</p>
    <p>Pages are compiled from manufacturer support articles, brand fitting notes, and public thread conventions (M22 as a 22 mm metric thread; GHT as 3/4-11.5 NH). Brand tables are labeled <em>confirmed</em> or <em>commonly reported</em>. When those disagree, the caliper wins.</p>
    <p>We are not a dealer and not affiliated with Sun Joe, Snow Joe, Kärcher, Ryobi, Techtronic, Simpson, AR Blue Clean, Greenworks, Stanley Black &amp; Decker, Generac, or PowerStroke. Product names identify compatibility, not endorsement.</p>
    <p>Corrections: <a href="/contact/">contact</a>. Sources: <a href="/sources/">listed</a>.</p>
